---
layout: base.njk
title: About
description: About Amy Sutherland, a photographer and artist based in Auburn, Maine, and how to get in touch.
permalink: /about/
shareImageFile: about/amy-gallery.jpg
shareImageAlt: Amy smiling at a college art exhibition, in front of a wall of framed photographs.
---
<div class="wrap">
  {#- Banner: a close crop of the exhibition photo with a short intro over it -#}
  <div class="about-banner">
    {% picture "about/amy-gallery.jpg", "Amy smiling at a college art exhibition, standing in front of a wall of Amy's framed photographs.", "(min-width: 72rem) 72rem, 100vw", "eager", [960] %}
    <div class="about-banner-text">
      <h1 class="logo-heading"><span class="name-light">Hi,</span> <span class="name-bold">I’m Amy</span></h1>
      <p>Photographer and artist in Auburn, Maine, chasing the moments that make you feel something.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-cols">
    <section aria-labelledby="story-title">
      <h2 id="story-title" class="logo-heading"><span class="name-light">My</span> <span class="name-bold">story</span></h2>
      <p>I'm a photographer and artist based in Auburn, Maine. What draws me to photography is emotion: a laugh, a quiet glance, a dog mid-grin, the sky going dark at totality. I photograph animals, the people I love and the moments in between, and I'm happy to wait as long as it takes for a feeling to show itself.</p>
      <p>Beyond the camera, I make digital illustrations, relief carvings and logos. Different tools, same goal: making something that makes you feel something.</p>
    
      <h2 class="logo-heading"><span class="name-light">Say</span> <span class="name-bold">hello</span></h2>
      <p>Want to talk photos, art or design? I'd love to hear from you.</p>
      <div class="about-actions"><span class="about-mail">
        <a class="about-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>Email me</a>
        <button type="button" class="about-copy" data-copy="{{ site.email }}" data-status="copy-status" hidden><svg class="i-copy" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/></svg><svg class="i-check" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><span class="copy-label">Copy email</span></button></span>
      </div>
      <p class="visually-hidden" id="copy-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      {%- if site.social.length %}
      <p>You can also find me on:</p>
      <ul>
        {%- for link in site.social %}
        <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="facts-title">
      <h2 id="facts-title" class="logo-heading"><span class="name-light">Quick</span> <span class="name-bold">facts</span></h2>
      <ul class="about-facts">
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Education</b><span class="small">University of Maine, Orono, 2018. Studio art and art education; minors in graphic design and art history.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5L7.5 21 12 18.5 16.5 21 15 13.5"/></svg></span><span><b>Award</b><span class="small">2017 Juried Student Art Exhibition, Lord Hall Gallery, for <a href="/photography/light-columns/">Light columns</a>.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 20l4-1L19 8l-3-3L5 16z"/><path d="M14 7l3 3"/></svg></span><span><b>Design</b><span class="small">Logos for <a href="/projects/windham-parks-and-recreation/">Windham Parks &amp; Recreation</a> (in use 2016–2025) and <a href="/projects/eric-s-miniatures/">Eric's Miniatures</a>.</span></span></li>
      </ul>

    </section>
  </div>
</div>
